w  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received unfixed  labeled  Marianne Richard  445 65 67  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm piece of tan red fibrofatty tissue with a short suture designating the superior margin  a long suture designating the lateral margin  and three localizing wires  The posterior margin is inked black  the anterior blue  the medial green  and the lateral yellow  The specimen contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm hemorrhagic cavity containing blood clot  The cavity comes to 0 5cm from the posterior margin  0 7cm from the anterior margin  1 3cm from the lateral margin  1 5cm from the medial margin  1 6cm from the inferior margin  and more than 2 0cm from the superior margin  Surrounding the cavity is diffused  dense nodular gray white fibrous tissue containing a silver metal clip  Representative sections are submitted from inferior to superior as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  with the inferior margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and the superior en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The tissue containing the silver metal clip is submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the cavity is represented in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in fixative  labeled  Marianne Richard  REMOVED_DATE  left axillary sentinel node hot and blue  103  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm aggregate of tan pink fibrofatty tissue containing two tan red lymph nodes REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  The latter is inked black and both are entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   In the same container are several additional tan red nodules up to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm in greatest dimension  which submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in fixative  labeled  Marianne Richard  REMOVED_DATE  left breast inferior final shaved margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REM