ptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  19 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 08 12 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm irregular fragment of fibroadipose tissue  containing a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm firm  tan  well circumscribed nodule that abuts several margins  Representative sections of the nodule are submitted in A through C  representative sections of grossly unremarkable parenchyma are submitted in D and E  Gross Description by  MELINDA J  FAN  MD Resident  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  1   RIGHT BREAST   LESION GROSSLY SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  ABUTTING MARGIN  O R  Resident  MELINDA J  FAN  MD O R  Diagnosis by  CHIN LEE WU  MD  PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Positive.
