ble breast tissue  entirely submitted in cassettes L and M  Labeled  new medial margin with clips  is a 7 x 5 x 0 7cm fragment of breast oriented by the surgeon as one clip equals deep margin  two clips equals inferior margin  three clips equal anterior  superficial  margin  The specimen is inked black on the medial surface  blue on the lateral surface  Serially sectioned from anterior  superficial  to deep to reveal unremarkable breast parenchyma  submitted entirely as follows  N W  Anterior to deep with R  T and V in the superior half and S  U  W in the inferior half  X  Deepest margin  Gross Description by  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD Resident  TAI YUAN LIN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Rosa Sung Eun Choi  M D  David R Whittaker  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT  NEW LATERAL MARGINS    EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT  NEW ANTERIOR MEDIAL MARGIN    EXCISI PART D  BREAST  LEFT  NEW MEDIAL MARGIN    EXCISION   report_end  , Positive.
